  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the brown rice in a fine mesh strainer and drain well.",
    "In a medium saucepan, combine the kombu and 2 cups of water.",
    "Bring the water to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the kombu from the water and discard.",
    "Add the grated ginger, minced garlic, ground turmeric, ground cumin, smoked paprika, and chili flakes to the saucepan.",
    "Stir to combine and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the brown rice to the saucepan and stir to combine with the spice mixture.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15-20 minutes or until the rice is tender.",
    "Fluff the cooked rice with a fork and stir in the rosewater and lemon juice.",
    "Transfer the rice mixture to a Korean brass bowl.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
